{
  "name": "FB · Nightly Generator (WF1)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": { "interval": [ { "field": "cronExpression", "expression": "0 6 * * *" } ] }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [0, 120],
      "id": "wf1-schedule-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "name": "Nightly 06:00 ET"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "fb-generate-now",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [0, 320],
      "id": "wf1-webhook-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "name": "On-demand (fb-generate-now)",
      "webhookId": "fb-generate-now"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "secret",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.headers.authorization }}",
              "rightValue": "=Bearer __N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET__",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [220, 320],
      "id": "wf1-verify-0000-0000-000000000003",
      "name": "Verify Secret"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=__SUPABASE_URL__/rest/v1/fb_subtopics?status=eq.active&order=last_used_at.asc.nullsfirst,times_used.asc&limit=1",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [
          { "name": "apikey", "value": "YOUR_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY" },
          { "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer YOUR_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY" }
        ] },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [460, 200],
      "id": "wf1-get-subtopic-000000000004",
      "name": "Get LRU Subtopic"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=__SUPABASE_URL__/rest/v1/fb_messaging_prompts?is_active=eq.true&select=name,body",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [
          { "name": "apikey", "value": "YOUR_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY" },
          { "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer YOUR_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY" }
        ] },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [680, 200],
      "id": "wf1-get-prompts-0000000000005",
      "name": "Get Prompts + Bank"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Pick the least-used archetype over the last 14 days (fallback: round-robin).\n// Build the generator prompt by filling {{style_guide}}, {{message_bank}},\n// {{pillar}}, {{archetype}}, {{subtopic}} from the prompts + subtopic + bank.\n// The pillar comes from the selected subtopic. Returns { system, user, subtopic_id, pillar, archetype }.\nconst archetypes = ['myth-bust','secret-reveal','story','mistake-expose','seasonal','thought-leadership','community-cause','social-proof'];\nconst archetype = archetypes[new Date().getDate() % archetypes.length];\nreturn [{ json: { archetype } }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [900, 200],
      "id": "wf1-build-prompt-000000000006",
      "name": "Build Generator Prompt"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [
          { "name": "x-api-key", "value": "__ANTHROPIC_API_KEY__" },
          { "name": "anthropic-version", "value": "2023-06-01" },
          { "name": "content-type", "value": "application/json" }
        ] },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: '__ANTHROPIC_MODEL__', max_tokens: 1200, system: $json.system, messages: [ { role: 'user', content: $json.user } ] }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [1120, 200],
      "id": "wf1-anthropic-gen-00000000007",
      "name": "Anthropic: Generator"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Tolerant JSON parse: strip ```json fences, then JSON.parse; on failure extract\n// the first balanced {...}. Returns the generator object { post_body, first_comment, image_concept, ... }.\nlet t = $json.content?.[0]?.text || '';\nt = t.replace(/```json|```/g, '').trim();\nlet out;\ntry { out = JSON.parse(t); } catch (e) {\n  const m = t.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/); out = m ? JSON.parse(m[0]) : {};\n}\nreturn [{ json: out }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1340, 200],
      "id": "wf1-parse-gen-000000000008",
      "name": "Parse JSON (tolerant)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [
          { "name": "x-api-key", "value": "__ANTHROPIC_API_KEY__" },
          { "name": "anthropic-version", "value": "2023-06-01" },
          { "name": "content-type", "value": "application/json" }
        ] },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: '__ANTHROPIC_MODEL__', max_tokens: 400, messages: [ { role: 'user', content: 'Image prompt for: ' + $json.image_concept } ] }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [1560, 200],
      "id": "wf1-anthropic-img-00000000009",
      "name": "Anthropic: Image Prompt"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "__IMAGE_API_URL__",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [ { "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer __IMAGE_API_KEY__" } ] },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ prompt: $json.content?.[0]?.text || '' }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [1780, 200],
      "id": "wf1-gen-image-0000000000010",
      "name": "Generate Image (swappable)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=__SUPABASE_URL__/storage/v1/object/fb-images/{{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-LL-dd') }}-{{ $randomString || $workflow.id }}.png",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [
          { "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer YOUR_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY" },
          { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "image/png" }
        ] },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [2000, 200],
      "id": "wf1-upload-0000000000011",
      "name": "Upload to fb-images"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=__SUPABASE_URL__/rest/v1/fb_posts",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [
          { "name": "apikey", "value": "YOUR_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY" },
          { "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer YOUR_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY" },
          { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "name": "Prefer", "value": "return=representation" }
        ] },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ scheduled_date: $json.scheduled_date, target: 'both', pillar: $json.pillar, archetype: $json.archetype, post_body: $json.post_body, first_comment: $json.first_comment, image_concept: $json.image_concept, image_url: $json.image_url, subtopic_id: $json.subtopic_id, copy_status: 'pending', image_status: 'pending', revision: 0 }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [2220, 200],
      "id": "wf1-insert-post-0000000012",
      "name": "Insert fb_posts (public image URL)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.groupme.com/v3/bots/post",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ bot_id: '__GROUPME_BOT_ID__', text: '📝 New post draft + image ready for ' + $json.scheduled_date + ' — review in the Dashboard.' }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [2440, 200],
      "id": "wf1-groupme-00000000000013",
      "name": "GroupMe Notify"
    },
    {
      "parameters": { "respondWith": "json", "responseBody": "={{ $json }}", "options": {} },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [2660, 320],
      "id": "wf1-respond-000000000014",
      "name": "Respond"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF1 — Nightly Generator\nRuns at POST_TIME_LOCAL (06:00) in TZ America/New_York. Also exposes the `fb-generate-now` webhook (verify `Authorization: Bearer __N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET__`) that the Dashboard 'Generate Now' button calls with { scheduled_date }.\n\nPipeline: next uncovered date → least-recently-used active subtopic (its pillar) → least-used archetype (14d) → prompts + message bank → Anthropic generator → image prompt → Generate Image (swap per IMAGE_PROVIDER) → upload to the PUBLIC fb-images bucket → insert fb_posts (copy_status/image_status='pending') → bump subtopic last_used_at/times_used → GroupMe.\n\nReplace `YOUR_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` and `__...__` placeholders with credentials/values on import.",
        "height": 320, "width": 420
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, -220],
      "id": "wf1-note-00000000000015",
      "name": "About WF1"
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
